msgid ""
"klipper-git is packaged for Arch Linux, and has a PKGBUILD (package build "
"script) available at [Arch User "
"Repository](https://aur.archlinux.org/cgit/aur.git/tree/PKGBUILD?h=klipper-"
"git)."
msgstr ""
"klipper-git är paketerat för Arch Linux och har en PKGBUILD-fil, ett "
"paketeringsskript, i [Arch User Repository](https://aur.archlinux.org/cgit/"
"aur.git/tree/PKGBUILD?h=klipper-git)."

